# Panic-sites budget (scripts/panic-sites.py, `just panic-sites`, ADR-0051):
# the panic-class sites per file of the tiered crates, counted by one clippy
# pass with the panic set as `-W` flags over the workspace's lib and bin
# targets. Each entry is a file that had sites when it was listed, with their
# count: it goes down, and up only by sites moved into its file or revealed by
# a rule the base did not count. An unlisted file has none. `just panic-sites-update` lowers an entry,
# removes it at zero, and raises or adds one by those moved and revealed sites.
# A crate with no entry carries the zero attribute at its roots
# (`just panic-sites` names it).

crates/call-limiter-runner/src/main.rs 5
crates/call-limiter/src/metrics.rs 4
crates/call-limiter/src/server.rs 1
crates/call-limiter/src/store.rs 18
crates/load-shed/src/retry_after.rs 1
crates/load-shed/src/sampler.rs 5
crates/load-shed/src/token_bucket.rs 2
crates/metric-values/src/fixed.rs 6
crates/metric-values/src/open.rs 7
